 kit leases - lists, takes, renews, and releases the paths each issue's work claims

   one of
   *kit leases*  lists, takes, renews, and releases the paths each issue's work claims

     --json   --jq
                  one JSON object, {now, leases}: every lease, and whether it is live

   take        claims the paths for the issue, here
   renew       moves each lease's expiry to its term from now
   release     deletes each lease, here and on the primary remote
   --check     refuses a path the branch changed outside its own lease


 kit leases
